<div class="page-head"><div><h1>Set up Money</h1><p>Choose the currency and date for this inventory's books. This creates no opening stock, invoice, bill or payment.</p></div></div>
<section class="card card-body"><% if(Number(settings?.enabled)===1){ %><p>Money is already set up in <strong><%= settings.base_currency %></strong>. Existing posted records and their currency remain unchanged.</p><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/accounting/setup" class="stack-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="importId" value="<%= plan?.id||'' %>">
<div class="field"><label for="money-currency">Currency</label><select id="money-currency" class="select" name="currency" required <%= Number(settings?.enabled)===1?'disabled':'' %>><% currencies.forEach(function(code){ %><option value="<%= code %>" <%= code===(settings?.base_currency||'USD')?'selected':'' %>><%= code %> — <%= new Intl.DisplayNames(['en'],{type:'currency'}).of(code) %></option><% }); %></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="money-start-date">Opening date</label><input id="money-start-date" class="input" type="date" name="startDate" value="<%= settings?.accounting_start_date||today %>" required <%= Number(settings?.enabled)===1?'disabled':'' %>></div>
<p>Your source file stays saved. Stock and value still require a separate review and approval after this setup.</p><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit"><%= Number(settings?.enabled)===1?(plan?'Recheck this file':'Open Money'):(plan?'Set up Money and recheck this file':'Set up Money') %></button></form></section>
